{"name": "s3", "dur": 84.16, "lines": [{"id": "c01", "t0": 0.35, "t1": 1.59, "clip": 0.3, "text": "“能跑 224G”，", "ch": [0.35, 0.474, 0.598, 0.722, 0.846, 0.97, 1.094, 1.218, 1.342, 1.466], "sub": null, "big": "“能跑 224G”，", "seg": "open", "src": "新增"}, {"id": "c02", "t0": 1.99, "t1": 2.87, "clip": 1.94, "text": "只说了一半。", "ch": [1.99, 2.137, 2.283, 2.43, 2.577, 2.723], "sub": null, "big": "只说了一半。", "seg": "open", "src": "新增"}, {"id": "c03", "t0": 3.27, "t1": 4.28, "clip": 3.22, "text": "还得问三个问题。", "ch": [3.27, 3.396, 3.522, 3.649, 3.775, 3.901, 4.027, 4.154], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "open", "src": "新增"}, {"id": "c04", "t0": 4.73, "t1": 11.6, "clip": 4.67, "text": "AI 让芯片之间要传的数据越来越多，可芯片的出口数量增长有限，提高“每条路跑多快”，就成了重要方向。", "ch": [4.73, 4.865, 5.0, 5.135, 5.27, 5.405, 5.54, 5.675, 5.81, 5.945, 6.08, 6.215, 6.35, 6.485, 6.62, 6.755, 6.89, 7.025, 7.26, 7.395, 7.531, 7.666, 7.802, 7.937, 8.072, 8.208, 8.343, 8.478, 8.614, 8.749, 8.885, 9.22, 9.342, 9.464, 9.585, 9.707, 9.829, 9.951, 10.073, 10.195, 10.316, 10.438, 10.66, 10.777, 10.895, 11.012, 11.13, 11.248, 11.365, 11.482], "sub": "出口有限，只能让每条路跑更快", "big": null, "seg": "explain", "src": "L33"}, {"id": "c05", "t0": 11.85, "t1": 14.75, "clip": 11.77, "text": "于是 SerDes 的速度，大约每过几年就要翻一倍。", "ch": [11.85, 11.933, 12.016, 12.099, 12.181, 12.264, 12.347, 12.43, 12.513, 12.596, 12.679, 12.761, 12.844, 12.927, 13.13, 13.265, 13.4, 13.535, 13.67, 13.805, 13.94, 14.075, 14.21, 14.345, 14.48, 14.615], "sub": "每条通道的速度，几年翻一倍", "big": null, "seg": "explain", "src": "L34"}, {"id": "c06", "t0": 15.2, "t1": 19.63, "clip": 15.14, "text": "速度一翻倍，信号在路上更容易变模糊，收货端更难听准节拍。", "ch": [15.2, 15.322, 15.443, 15.565, 15.687, 15.808, 16.06, 16.206, 16.352, 16.497, 16.643, 16.789, 16.935, 17.081, 17.227, 17.372, 17.518, 17.664, 17.92, 18.091, 18.262, 18.433, 18.604, 18.775, 18.946, 19.117, 19.288, 19.459], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "explain", "src": "L35"}, {"id": "c07", "t0": 19.88, "t1": 25.44, "clip": 19.81, "text": "所以今天的高速 SerDes，自己也带着不少“整理”能力，在发出和收进时就把信号修一修。", "ch": [19.88, 19.97, 20.06, 20.15, 20.24, 20.33, 20.42, 20.51, 20.6, 20.69, 20.78, 20.87, 20.96, 21.05, 21.14, 21.48, 21.594, 21.709, 21.823, 21.937, 22.051, 22.166, 22.28, 22.394, 22.509, 22.623, 22.737, 22.851, 22.966, 23.22, 23.368, 23.516, 23.664, 23.812, 23.96, 24.108, 24.256, 24.404, 24.552, 24.7, 24.848, 24.996, 25.144, 25.292], "sub": "发出和收进时，把信号修一修", "big": null, "seg": "explain", "src": "L36"}, {"id": "c08", "t0": 25.69, "t1": 28.36, "clip": 25.64, "text": "这些额外的工作，都要耗电、占芯片面积。", "ch": [25.69, 25.822, 25.955, 26.087, 26.22, 26.352, 26.485, 26.617, 26.88, 27.01, 27.14, 27.27, 27.4, 27.63, 27.752, 27.873, 27.995, 28.117, 28.238], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "explain", "src": "L37"}, {"id": "c09", "t0": 28.81, "t1": 34.14, "clip": 28.72, "text": "跑得更快，同时让每送出一个比特少花一点电，是 SerDes 每一代都要面对的难题。", "ch": [28.81, 28.94, 29.07, 29.2, 29.33, 29.59, 29.74, 29.89, 30.04, 30.19, 30.34, 30.49, 30.64, 30.79, 30.94, 31.09, 31.24, 31.39, 31.54, 31.69, 31.84, 32.21, 32.306, 32.403, 32.499, 32.596, 32.693, 32.789, 32.886, 32.982, 33.078, 33.175, 33.272, 33.368, 33.465, 33.561, 33.657, 33.754, 33.851, 33.947, 34.044], "sub": "更快，同时每比特更省电", "big": null, "seg": "explain", "src": "L38"}, {"id": "c10", "t0": 34.59, "t1": 39.12, "clip": 34.53, "text": "从投资角度，先记住一点：SerDes 很少作为一颗独立的芯片单独出售。", "ch": [34.59, 34.723, 34.856, 34.99, 35.123, 35.256, 35.389, 35.523, 35.656, 35.789, 35.922, 36.056, 36.189, 36.316, 36.444, 36.571, 36.699, 36.826, 36.953, 37.081, 37.208, 37.336, 37.463, 37.591, 37.718, 37.846, 37.973, 38.1, 38.228, 38.355, 38.483, 38.61, 38.738, 38.865, 38.993], "sub": "SerDes 很少单独卖", "big": null, "seg": "explain", "src": "L39"}, {"id": "c11", "t0": 39.57, "t1": 44.19, "clip": 39.51, "text": "它更像一种“能力”，嵌在 GPU、交换芯片和光模块里的芯片之中；", "ch": [39.57, 39.719, 39.868, 40.017, 40.166, 40.315, 40.464, 40.613, 40.762, 40.911, 41.06, 41.188, 41.316, 41.444, 41.571, 41.699, 41.827, 41.955, 42.104, 42.253, 42.402, 42.551, 42.7, 42.849, 42.998, 43.147, 43.296, 43.445, 43.594, 43.743, 43.892, 44.041], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "explain", "src": "L40"}, {"id": "c12", "t0": 44.44, "t1": 49.87, "clip": 44.39, "text": "常以设计模块，也就是 IP 的形式，授权给芯片公司使用；大公司则多半自己研发。", "ch": [44.44, 44.587, 44.734, 44.88, 45.027, 45.174, 45.321, 45.467, 45.587, 45.707, 45.828, 45.948, 46.068, 46.188, 46.308, 46.428, 46.548, 46.668, 46.788, 46.935, 47.082, 47.228, 47.375, 47.522, 47.669, 47.815, 47.962, 48.109, 48.256, 48.402, 48.549, 48.696, 48.843, 48.989, 49.136, 49.283, 49.43, 49.576, 49.723], "sub": "IP 授权，或自己研发", "big": null, "seg": "explain", "src": "L41"}, {"id": "c13", "t0": 50.32, "t1": 54.52, "clip": 50.27, "text": "所以看一家做高速互连芯片的公司，不能只看它宣称跑得多快。", "ch": [50.32, 50.464, 50.608, 50.751, 50.895, 51.039, 51.183, 51.326, 51.47, 51.614, 51.758, 51.901, 52.045, 52.189, 52.333, 52.476, 52.75, 52.898, 53.045, 53.193, 53.34, 53.488, 53.635, 53.783, 53.93, 54.078, 54.225, 54.373], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "explain", "src": "L42"}, {"id": "c14", "t0": 54.97, "t1": 59.24, "clip": 54.92, "text": "同样号称跑得快，要问清楚：第一，在什么路况下跑到这个速度？", "ch": [54.97, 55.116, 55.263, 55.409, 55.555, 55.701, 55.848, 55.994, 56.29, 56.414, 56.538, 56.662, 56.786, 57.09, 57.187, 57.283, 57.54, 57.671, 57.802, 57.932, 58.063, 58.194, 58.325, 58.455, 58.586, 58.717, 58.848, 58.978, 59.109], "sub": "① 什么路况下跑到的？", "big": null, "seg": "reveal", "src": "L43"}, {"id": "c15", "t0": 59.49, "t1": 61.36, "clip": 59.44, "text": "第二，每个比特花多少电？", "ch": [59.49, 59.633, 59.777, 60.03, 60.178, 60.326, 60.473, 60.621, 60.769, 60.917, 61.064, 61.212], "sub": "② 每个比特花多少电？", "big": null, "seg": "reveal", "src": "L43"}, {"id": "c16", "t0": 61.61, "t1": 64.0, "clip": 61.56, "text": "第三，是否已经在真实芯片上跑通？", "ch": [61.61, 61.759, 61.909, 62.058, 62.208, 62.357, 62.506, 62.656, 62.805, 62.954, 63.104, 63.253, 63.403, 63.552, 63.701, 63.851], "sub": "③ 真实芯片上跑通了吗？", "big": null, "seg": "reveal", "src": "L43"}, {"id": "c17", "t0": 64.25, "t1": 67.35, "clip": 64.18, "text": "在这之后，再看它的 SerDes 是自研还是授权。", "ch": [64.25, 64.385, 64.52, 64.654, 64.789, 64.924, 65.045, 65.167, 65.288, 65.409, 65.53, 65.652, 65.773, 65.894, 66.016, 66.137, 66.258, 66.38, 66.501, 66.622, 66.743, 66.865, 66.986, 67.107, 67.229], "sub": "然后：自研，还是授权？", "big": null, "seg": "reveal", "src": "L44"}, {"id": "c18", "t0": 67.6, "t1": 70.73, "clip": 67.53, "text": "以后看 DSP、光模块，还会反复用到这几个问题。", "ch": [67.6, 67.775, 67.95, 68.125, 68.3, 68.475, 68.65, 68.825, 69.25, 69.385, 69.52, 69.655, 69.89, 69.96, 70.03, 70.1, 70.17, 70.24, 70.31, 70.38, 70.45, 70.52, 70.59, 70.66], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "reveal", "src": "L45"}, {"id": "c19", "t0": 71.18, "t1": 71.93, "clip": 71.12, "text": "一句话带走。", "ch": [71.18, 71.305, 71.43, 71.555, 71.68, 71.805], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "end", "src": "L46"}, {"id": "c20", "t0": 72.18, "t1": 78.95, "clip": 72.11, "text": "SerDes 难在越跑越快，还要读得准、更省电；看一家公司，先问路况、每比特的电、真实芯片跑通没有。", "ch": [72.18, 72.308, 72.437, 72.565, 72.693, 72.821, 72.95, 73.078, 73.206, 73.335, 73.463, 73.591, 73.72, 73.848, 73.976, 74.114, 74.252, 74.391, 74.529, 74.667, 74.805, 74.943, 75.081, 75.22, 75.358, 75.496, 75.634, 75.772, 75.91, 76.049, 76.187, 76.325, 76.463, 76.601, 76.739, 76.878, 77.016, 77.154, 77.292, 77.43, 77.568, 77.707, 77.845, 77.983, 78.121, 78.259, 78.397, 78.536, 78.674, 78.812], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "end", "src": "L49"}, {"id": "c21", "t0": 79.2, "t1": 82.56, "clip": 79.13, "text": "下一条：信号上路以后，为什么会越跑越模糊？", "ch": [79.2, 79.36, 79.52, 79.68, 79.84, 80.0, 80.16, 80.32, 80.48, 80.64, 80.8, 80.96, 81.12, 81.28, 81.44, 81.6, 81.76, 81.92, 82.08, 82.24, 82.4], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "end", "src": "新增"}], "shots": [{"kind": "spec", "t0": 0, "paper": false, "first": "c01", "t1": 4.43}, {"kind": "lanes", "t0": 4.43, "paper": false, "first": "c04", "t1": 14.9}, {"kind": "blur", "t0": 14.9, "paper": false, "first": "c06", "t1": 28.51}, {"kind": "seesaw", "t0": 28.51, "paper": false, "first": "c09", "t1": 34.29}, {"kind": "desk", "t0": 34.29, "paper": true, "first": "c10", "strips": [{"id": "V1", "line": "c10", "from": "很少", "to": "出售"}], "tape": {"text": "从投资角度"}, "t1": 39.27}, {"kind": "inside", "t0": 39.27, "paper": false, "first": "c11", "t1": 50.02}, {"kind": "three", "t0": 50.02, "paper": false, "first": "c13", "t1": 70.88}, {"kind": "take", "t0": 70.88, "paper": true, "first": "c19", "strips": [{"id": "E0", "line": "c19", "from": null, "to": null}, {"id": "E6", "line": "c20", "from": "难在", "to": "读得准"}, {"id": "Y2", "line": "c20", "from": "路况", "to": "路况"}, {"id": "Y3", "line": "c20", "from": "每比特", "to": "的电"}, {"id": "Y4", "line": "c20", "from": "真实芯片", "to": "没有"}], "cy": 700, "t1": 84.16}], "hudIn": 4.43}